Both independent negative assertions exit 1 because the census admits their compiling plants. They preserve the existing admission owner and all checks; these are narrowly scoped alternate paths. Required repair: cover seal/token production and mutation beyond composite literals, and resolve the particular callback provenance rather than granting every nil-resolved callee in a profile function. Add focused same-gate regressions and qualifying narrowing evidence. A new lexical name list or a runtime cryptographic mechanism is not requested. Keep the already-correct semantic admission behavior.

